**##Expected Outcome:**

MediVault aims to provide one place to upload medical documents, review a chronological timeline, extract text from supported scans, view AI-assisted summaries, and share selected records through a controlled link. Recipient verification, server-side permission checks, expiry, and revocation help users control sharing. By making existing records easier to find and review, MediVault may help support continuity of care, but it cannot guarantee that repeated tests or medical errors will be eliminated.



**## Improvements:**

* Email-based OTP delivery bound to the selected recipient email and sharing session.
* More reliable OCR and scanned-PDF processing.
* Structured medication reconciliation and a validated drug-interaction data source.
* Improved duplicate-test matching that considers test details, dates, and results.
* Strong server-side session/token revocation and production database migrations.
* Deployment with appropriate privacy, security, and data-retention controls.

